{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"understanding\": \"他此刻又能享受一阵愉快变得灵动、细节丰盛时的即时满足。他在乎的不只是这份愉快能不能继续，也在乎它鲜活展开时带来的真实滋味。即使这股劲头中间有所停顿，随后又缓和，正在发生的满足也并未因此失去。\",\n  \"why_now\": {\n    \"earlier_fact\": \"H2：他此前已经体验过，愉快变得鲜活、轻快时，那个当下本身就能带来片刻满足；即使愉快随后缓和，已经得到的满足仍然真实。\",\n    \"bridge\": \"这一段重新出现了此前相近的主题形态，但细节更加繁密，愉快的展开也显得更活跃。此前已经形成的体验方式，使他能够从这种鲜活的展开本身得到满足，而不必等到它持续更久，才觉得这一刻值得享受。\",\n    \"current\": \"他现在享受的是愉快在细节中变得灵动时的滋味。中间短暂的停驻、再度涌起与缓和，可以属于同一阵愉快的经历；满足就在它活跃展开的当下，而不只取决于它能维持多久。\",\n    \"without\": \"如果没有H2，仍能从音乐中听出细节变得繁密、起伏更加鲜明，却缺少具体依据说明，为什么这种活泼的展开本身会成为他的满足来源。这里没有必要再编出另一件往事来解释。\"\n  },\n  \"used\": [\n    \"H2\"\n  ],\n  \"new_history\": [],\n  \"self_check\": {\n    \"history_effective\": true,\n    \"pseudo_cause\": false,\n    \"music_as_external_fact\": false,\n    \"generic\": false,\n    \"note\": \"H2具体解释了他为什么能从愉快的鲜活展开中获得即时满足，而不只是重复说感受变强或变深。音乐中的主题回归和力度变化只用于理解当下的主观体验，没有被当作外部回应或关系变化的证据。本段延续了已有的心理事实，没有足够依据建立新的、以后独立有用的历史事实。\"\n  }\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "50c9faf4-9402-49be-a1bc-0762ab3b10c2", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261025T220357926364Z", "elapsed_seconds": 39.578, "completed_utc": "2026-10-25T22:04:37.507018+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "8254bc18d1d70b61562560c9380c21cc7864f0a349f552eee9611cdb5888fb25", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261025T220357926364Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "01f52977601d4c5e8c80c6b231aa880b33976d0358cfaa3cecb018b1accbdb89"}}}
